  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The applicant has failed to demonstrate, on the balance of probabilities, that the baseline lawful use of the property falls within Use Class C3 as a dwellinghouse that functions&amp;nbsp; separately/independently of St. Barnabus Church and its wider site.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;The submitted evidence indicates that the property operates as a rectory (Use Class F1/Sui Generis) that is ancillary to the church, meaning the proposed use as a self-contained residential dwellinghouse (Use Class C3) constitutes a material change of use.&lt;/p&gt;"
